<!-- @after Staff Engineer Thinking :: check -->
### Test the decision

<details><summary>A pricing rule can be tested without Android. Which boundary earns the fastest useful feedback?</summary>

A focused rule test with controlled inputs. Add a higher layer only for behavior that crosses that boundary.
</details>

<details><summary>The second run passes. Can the first red run disappear from the dashboard?</summary>

No. Keep first-attempt reliability and diagnostic artifacts; eventual green hides intermittent risk.
</details>

<details><summary>The contract fixture passes while the provider changes its schema. What is missing?</summary>

Evidence that the fixture still represents the provider, with an owner and a refresh/verification process.
</details>

